  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Statement-I $\\rightarrow$ True\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/cXxE3dTZFz0xuFeP6Wbt8oIrirm863d8DfPh_QLqEK0.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n\nBoth are ring chain isomers \nStatement-II $\\rightarrow$ True<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/Un_8AlhBdUsfh7qK40IHL4aNXE_XzdO6WH6f2Bck9dc.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n\n\n\n$1^{\\circ}$ Amine and $2^{\\circ}$ Amine are different functional groups, hence both are functional group isomers.",
    "image": null
